WEBVTT

00:00:14.458 --> 00:00:16.250
"Excel Saga"

00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:21.333
"I, Koshi Rikdo, hereby
give my permission to make

00:00:21.333 --> 00:00:25.750
the Excel Saga anime
into a B movie action flick."

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:26.875
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.583
Wanna watch it?

00:00:40.667 --> 00:00:44.583
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:00:44.583 --> 00:00:48.375
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:56.333
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:00:56.333 --> 00:01:00.167
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:04.167
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:11.917
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:16.750
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:20.792
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:01:20.792 --> 00:01:24.708
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:01:24.708 --> 00:01:27.917
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:01:27.917 --> 00:01:30.208
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:30.208 --> 00:01:32.083
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:33.833
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:35.917
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:01:35.917 --> 00:01:40.583
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:43.833
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:48.333
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:56.208
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:26.917
"General, where in
the world are we headed?"

00:02:26.917 --> 00:02:29.125
"Who cares?! We have no purpose!"

00:02:29.667 --> 00:02:30.250
"But!"

00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:32.250
"Then, what are
we flying around for?!"

00:02:32.792 --> 00:02:36.083
"It's just for the dramatic
presentation of a B movie."

00:02:37.042 --> 00:02:38.250
"I see."

00:02:41.375 --> 00:02:43.958
This world is corrupt!

00:02:50.125 --> 00:02:52.625
Are you listening, Hyatt?

00:02:52.625 --> 00:02:53.792
Yes.

00:02:53.792 --> 00:02:55.750
The Earth is swamped with wars,

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.792
which give rise to
starvation, poverty, and death,

00:02:58.792 --> 00:03:00.333
and the people...

00:03:01.042 --> 00:03:03.500
The people cannot even
find regret within their hearts.

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:05.292
Are you really listening?

00:03:05.292 --> 00:03:07.125
But of course.

00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:11.417
They only concentrate on improving
their invincible military power.

00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:14.708
A lasting peace is
a dream beyond a dream!

00:03:14.708 --> 00:03:17.750
They spend their capital on their
hatred without a backwards glance

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:20.833
and they have completely given
up trying to understand each other.

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.000
Could they possibly have the
right to call themselves victims?!

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.208
No, they do not!

00:03:27.167 --> 00:03:30.333
There is only one thing that
could bring true control and stability

00:03:30.333 --> 00:03:33.333
to this world,
and that is our ACROSS...

00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:34.833
Hyatt...

00:03:39.708 --> 00:03:43.375
It seems that you are unable
to hear what I am saying.

00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:45.542
Not at all.

00:03:45.542 --> 00:03:50.292
I am listening, Lord Ilpalazzo.
Please continue.

00:03:50.292 --> 00:03:52.042
Well, that is a different issue.

00:03:52.042 --> 00:03:54.292
About today's mission...

00:03:57.292 --> 00:03:58.375
This is?

00:03:58.375 --> 00:04:01.417
Excel has gone missing.
Find her for me.

00:04:01.417 --> 00:04:03.083
Miss Excel?

00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:05.292
She looks like that.

00:04:05.292 --> 00:04:08.375
She was fasting for four days
and counting, due to lack of capital.

00:04:08.375 --> 00:04:11.417
This is a photo of her trying to
hide her hunger with a weird look.

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:15.208
Keeping in mind that she might
look more normal at present,

00:04:15.208 --> 00:04:17.208
please search for her!

00:04:17.208 --> 00:04:19.417
Hail, Ilpala...

00:04:26.292 --> 00:04:27.958
No good.

00:04:35.833 --> 00:04:39.333
It seems like she will
be more reliable than Excel.

00:05:05.875 --> 00:05:08.458
<i>Everyone, how have you been doing?</i>

00:05:08.458 --> 00:05:11.917
<i>I am in a pretty terrible predicament.</i>

00:05:11.917 --> 00:05:13.750
<i>Could it be that, in the end,</i>

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:17.083
<i>humans cannot reach an</i>
<i>understanding with one another?</i>

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:19.250
<i>I trespassed just a little bit</i>

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.958
<i>and they've imprisoned</i>
<i>me and interrogated me.</i>

00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:25.083
<i>I have not been given the right</i>
<i>to be silent or call an attorney.</i>

00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:29.292
<i>It has been a 24-hour endurance</i>
<i>torture fest with no explanation.</i>

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:32.417
<i>They keep mentioning</i>
<i>spies and secrets,</i>

00:05:32.417 --> 00:05:34.375
<i>but a skirmish like</i>
<i>this in such a remote area</i>

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:36.458
<i>is so totally unrelated</i>
<i>to someone like me,</i>

00:05:36.458 --> 00:05:39.125
<i>who serves Lord Ilpalazzo.</i>

00:05:39.125 --> 00:05:41.750
<i>Why can't they understand that?</i>

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.625
Oh, a little higher.

00:05:49.292 --> 00:05:52.125
<i>There are many others</i>
<i>who were caught the same as me,</i>

00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:54.708
<i>and I made some</i>
<i>friends as well, but...</i>

00:05:55.792 --> 00:05:59.292
<i>Their numbers dwindle</i>
<i>as the days go by.</i>

00:05:59.292 --> 00:06:01.042
<i>When we have</i>
<i>accomplished our conquest,</i>

00:06:01.042 --> 00:06:05.917
<i>perhaps there is a</i>
<i>need for a country-wide purge.</i>

00:06:05.917 --> 00:06:07.292
<i>Goddamn!</i>

00:06:07.833 --> 00:06:11.500
<i>Well, that's pretty</i>
<i>much what's been going on,</i>

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.042
<i>but I can't stay here too long</i>

00:06:13.042 --> 00:06:16.500
<i>and inconvenience</i>
<i>Lord Ilpalazzo, you know?</i>

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:20.333
<i>And so, as you can see, I am</i>
<i>independently carving my way home.</i>

00:06:20.333 --> 00:06:21.917
<i>However...</i>

00:06:21.917 --> 00:06:23.333
<i>Every so often,</i>

00:06:23.333 --> 00:06:26.083
<i>I find these things that</i>
<i>are difficult to comment on.</i>

00:06:26.083 --> 00:06:27.792
<i>So, I do wish to</i>
<i>return home safely soon,</i>

00:06:27.792 --> 00:06:31.667
<i>before I become like</i>
<i>this tomorrow.</i>

00:06:32.583 --> 00:06:34.958
<i>I am so hungry!</i>

00:06:34.958 --> 00:06:35.833
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:06:35.833 --> 00:06:40.375
<i>Putting on a weird look won't</i>
<i>hide the roar of my digestive organs.</i>

00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:43.542
<i>Come to think of it, what</i>
<i>could have happened to Menchi?</i>

00:06:43.542 --> 00:06:45.708
<i>This is exactly</i>
<i>what that mutt is for.</i>

00:06:45.708 --> 00:06:46.750
"That mutt"

00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:49.167
Cute little thing, aren't you?

00:06:49.167 --> 00:06:51.083
Hey, want this?

00:06:52.083 --> 00:06:54.792
There's no rush,
it won't run away.

00:06:54.792 --> 00:06:57.125
Come to think of it,
what's his name?

00:06:57.125 --> 00:06:59.375
Now that you mention it,
we hadn't decided yet.

00:06:59.375 --> 00:07:02.208
How about Micky?

00:07:02.208 --> 00:07:04.083
Micky?

00:07:04.083 --> 00:07:07.375
I remember, he liked dogs too.

00:07:07.375 --> 00:07:09.583
He used to say that
when he was discharged,

00:07:09.583 --> 00:07:11.417
he'd open a pet store in
his home state of Alabama.

00:07:11.417 --> 00:07:14.417
And he had to die like that!

00:07:14.417 --> 00:07:15.625
Let's stop this!

00:07:15.625 --> 00:07:17.417
But she's a female.

00:07:17.417 --> 00:07:18.875
So what?

00:07:18.875 --> 00:07:20.875
When he was discharged,
he was going to have surgery

00:07:20.875 --> 00:07:23.875
and become a woman in both body
and soul and live happily with me!

00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:26.083
And he had to die like that!

00:07:26.917 --> 00:07:29.750
Oh, well, anyway,
you're Micky now.

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.917
What are you men doing?!

00:07:32.667 --> 00:07:33.917
Y-Yes, Sir!

00:07:33.917 --> 00:07:36.208
W-We were playing with Micky!

00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:37.583
What?

00:07:39.042 --> 00:07:40.583
Is this Micky?

00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:42.667
Yes, it is, Sir!

00:07:46.417 --> 00:07:49.417
How many times do I have
to tell you? He's already dead!

00:07:49.417 --> 00:07:51.958
We have no time to
waste looking back on the past!

00:07:51.958 --> 00:07:54.375
We always have
only this moment to live.

00:07:54.375 --> 00:07:55.875
Y-Yes, Sir!

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:59.625
I'll give you wimps a
special training exercise!

00:07:59.625 --> 00:08:02.083
Build one doghouse
within the day!

00:08:02.083 --> 00:08:05.417
You'll get no mercy if
you don't make it on time!

00:08:05.417 --> 00:08:07.208
Y-Yes, Sir!

00:08:29.125 --> 00:08:30.792
Freedom!

00:08:32.042 --> 00:08:33.500
Freeze!

00:08:35.208 --> 00:08:37.208
You have the right to breathe.

00:08:37.208 --> 00:08:39.458
You have the
right to blink freely.

00:08:39.458 --> 00:08:41.875
You have the right
to pick your nose freely.

00:08:41.875 --> 00:08:42.708
Oh?

00:08:42.708 --> 00:08:47.458
Hey, you dog over there!
Might you be... Ow! Ow!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.833
I'm falling!

00:08:53.042 --> 00:08:56.958
Stay there and pray! For good
weather for tomorrow's execution!

00:08:56.958 --> 00:08:59.583
Of course, we'll still do
it even if it rains.

00:09:01.708 --> 00:09:04.042
Oh, stop!

00:09:04.042 --> 00:09:07.375
I believe this environment is far
too harsh for a beautiful heroine!

00:09:07.375 --> 00:09:08.875
Besides, what about food?!

00:09:08.875 --> 00:09:11.167
Oh, I guess there is some here.

00:09:12.167 --> 00:09:15.792
It got away!
Today's special on the menu!

00:09:15.792 --> 00:09:17.625
How noisy.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:25.375
I never thought anyone
else would come here.

00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:28.667
It has already been twenty years,
but you are the first.

00:09:28.667 --> 00:09:32.958
Who is this place?
Where are you? I am Excel.

00:09:32.958 --> 00:09:37.458
I am one who once tried to expose
their secret by infiltrating them.

00:09:37.458 --> 00:09:40.708
Though now, I am
just a wretched iron mask.

00:09:40.708 --> 00:09:44.542
But I came too close to the truth.

00:09:44.542 --> 00:09:46.833
Young one, there
are things in this world

00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:49.750
that one definitely does not
need to know, though it is too late.

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:55.250
That's no good! I have to quickly
get back to Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:56.917
Ilpalazzo?

00:10:00.667 --> 00:10:01.375
"This"

00:10:03.083 --> 00:10:06.875
How dazzling.
Your youth is your passion.

00:10:06.875 --> 00:10:07.917
Old man...

00:10:07.917 --> 00:10:10.708
I am not an old man!
Call me Tetchan.

00:10:10.708 --> 00:10:14.375
All right, Tetchan! Is there
any way to escape from here?

00:10:14.375 --> 00:10:16.625
It may sound cruel,
but no, there is not!

00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:18.625
The outer walls are slimy

00:10:18.625 --> 00:10:20.417
and there is no sign
of people passing by.

00:10:20.417 --> 00:10:22.583
We have absolutely
no hope of being rescued.

00:10:22.583 --> 00:10:24.375
Oh, come on!

00:10:24.375 --> 00:10:28.333
All that's left is to think of how
to enjoy this vast amount of time.

00:10:28.333 --> 00:10:31.500
Well, if you put your mind
to it, it can be pretty fun.

00:10:40.958 --> 00:10:44.667
I don't want to be in such a loveless,
dreamless, hopeless place!

00:10:44.667 --> 00:10:49.250
Who will aid Lord Ilpalazzo?!

00:11:04.125 --> 00:11:06.750
I've had enough! I'm leaving!

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.833
I will erase this apartment and
you guys from my life!

00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:12.667
Oh, come on.

00:11:12.667 --> 00:11:15.458
We only used your porn
for a potholder for a little bit.

00:11:15.458 --> 00:11:16.958
It could even enrich the flavor.

00:11:16.958 --> 00:11:18.000
"Soy sauce flavor..."

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.000
Shut up! I'm leaving!
I'm leaving right now!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:23.750
Good-bye and good-bye
to you bastards!

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:27.667
Good-bye! Good-bye! Good-bye!
Good-bye! Good-bye! Good-bye!

00:11:28.667 --> 00:11:30.000
This is...

00:11:36.542 --> 00:11:36.958
"Undisguised desire!"

00:11:36.958 --> 00:11:38.458
"Undisguised desire!"
Shut up!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.083
What's with that beauty?

00:11:51.833 --> 00:11:55.833
Is there anything
I can help you with?

00:11:56.667 --> 00:11:59.042
And you are?

00:11:59.042 --> 00:12:02.125
W-Well, I'm a run-of-the-mill
Watanabe just passing by.

00:12:02.125 --> 00:12:03.292
I...

00:12:03.292 --> 00:12:04.667
Yes?

00:12:04.667 --> 00:12:06.667
An apartment nearby...

00:12:06.667 --> 00:12:09.250
M-Maybe it'd be better
if you didn't talk?

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.333
I'll walk you there. Come on.

00:12:12.333 --> 00:12:13.833
Thank you so much.

00:12:13.833 --> 00:12:16.458
I am going to be living in

00:12:16.458 --> 00:12:20.708
room 204 of a
nearby apartment building.

00:12:20.708 --> 00:12:25.583
<i>A nearby apartment building?!</i>
<i>Room 204?! That's next door!</i>

00:12:25.583 --> 00:12:30.167
Nice to meet meet you.
I live next door...

00:12:30.167 --> 00:12:31.708
I'm Nabeshin.

00:12:31.708 --> 00:12:33.708
Not you! Hey!

00:12:40.875 --> 00:12:43.208
Hey, Micky! It's done!

00:12:47.333 --> 00:12:49.000
So, you like it then.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:52.875
Hey, we helped too.
Don't monopolize Micky.

00:12:52.875 --> 00:12:55.542
That's right.
Take a look at my art!

00:12:55.542 --> 00:12:56.917
Hey, Micky's female, remember?

00:12:56.917 --> 00:12:59.958
Oh, what a big mistake I've made!

