00:14:03.708 --> 00:14:04.458
Egg custard.

00:14:04.458 --> 00:14:05.250
Shiitake mushrooms.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.083
Hairy crabs.

00:14:06.083 --> 00:14:06.250
Garlic.

00:14:06.250 --> 00:14:06.875
Garlic.

00:14:06.875 --> 00:14:08.958
Chestnut and sweet potato dumpling.

00:14:08.958 --> 00:14:11.625
Oh, I hate this! I don't
want to waste the rest of my life

00:14:11.625 --> 00:14:14.542
on a game coming up with
names of foods that I can't eat!

00:14:14.542 --> 00:14:19.958
Well, that's life, those are life,
this is life, they're all life.

00:14:19.958 --> 00:14:22.500
Oh, no!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:26.042
That's right! I should live
more like a pretty girl and go...

00:14:26.042 --> 00:14:28.292
Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:14:28.292 --> 00:14:30.292
What is it, Excel?

00:14:30.292 --> 00:14:33.458
I love you a hell of a lot.

00:14:33.458 --> 00:14:37.458
I don't want to be doing monologue
four-frame comics either!

00:14:39.458 --> 00:14:41.000
Who's there?!

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:43.292
You haven't changed a bit, Tetchan!

00:14:43.292 --> 00:14:44.500
That voice!

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.708
That's right!

00:14:45.708 --> 00:14:49.625
Nabeshin has just arrived!

00:14:51.833 --> 00:14:52.750
Nabeshin!

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:53.667
Tetchan!

00:14:53.667 --> 00:14:55.167
Oh?

00:14:55.167 --> 00:14:56.667
How did you find this place?

00:14:56.667 --> 00:14:59.208
I asked an army
guy who got discharged.

00:14:59.667 --> 00:15:01.458
--You haven't changed.
--What about the heroine's position?

00:15:01.458 --> 00:15:03.500
--You're just like you were in the old days.
--What about the heroine's position?

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:04.167
--So are you.

00:15:04.167 --> 00:15:08.042
--Hello? Isn't this kinda cheap?
--So are you.

00:15:08.042 --> 00:15:11.042
Now, let's get outta here!

00:15:14.417 --> 00:15:16.208
Hey...

00:15:16.208 --> 00:15:18.208
I wish you well!

00:15:18.208 --> 00:15:19.958
Wait a minute!

00:15:19.958 --> 00:15:22.625
Are you just going to
leave me here and go?!

00:15:22.625 --> 00:15:25.875
I don't think it's too much to
ask to be saved at the same time!

00:15:25.875 --> 00:15:28.083
But you look heavy.

00:15:28.083 --> 00:15:29.500
Pissed!

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:31.708
I'm not that heavy!

00:15:31.708 --> 00:15:34.292
I'll hold it against you!
I'll hate you! I'll die on you!

00:15:34.292 --> 00:15:37.208
I'll die, become a ghost, and play
that game by your bed every night!

00:15:37.208 --> 00:15:38.042
Furthermore, I'll...

00:15:38.042 --> 00:15:40.000
And I'll only say stuff
like that! On top of that, you...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:40.708
"Emergency Exit"

00:15:40.708 --> 00:15:41.917
"Emergency Exit"
Let's go.

00:15:41.917 --> 00:15:43.208
"Emergency Exit"
Thanks a bunch.

00:15:43.208 --> 00:15:44.875
Escapees!

00:15:50.875 --> 00:15:52.375
"File Footage"

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:58.292
"File Footage"

00:15:58.833 --> 00:16:00.667
Get them!

00:16:02.792 --> 00:16:03.917
Nabeshin!

00:16:03.917 --> 00:16:05.917
Yeah, this is bad.

00:16:05.917 --> 00:16:08.583
Let's split up from here.

00:16:08.583 --> 00:16:09.583
Take this with you.

00:16:09.583 --> 00:16:11.583
That's some dandruff, man.

00:16:11.583 --> 00:16:13.583
I wish you luck!

00:16:14.833 --> 00:16:18.375
Hey, hey, they're even
skipping along too, you know...

00:16:18.375 --> 00:16:19.208
There she is!

00:16:19.208 --> 00:16:19.833
"Thump"

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:24.250
This way!

00:16:24.958 --> 00:16:26.500
What's so funny?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:29.792
I never thought I'd be in
a fix like this with you again.

00:16:29.792 --> 00:16:31.500
It brings back old memories.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.625
We can reminisce together later.

00:16:33.625 --> 00:16:35.958
How's Space Butler doing?

00:16:35.958 --> 00:16:38.958
Oh, he's still the idiot
that he's always been.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:40.917
What's wrong?

00:16:40.917 --> 00:16:42.292
A snake!

00:16:42.292 --> 00:16:44.083
An anaconda?!

00:16:45.958 --> 00:16:46.958
How careless!

00:16:46.958 --> 00:16:49.500
Who would have thought
there'd be an anaconda here?!

00:16:49.500 --> 00:16:51.458
Hang in there!

00:16:53.042 --> 00:16:54.292
Are you all right?

00:16:54.292 --> 00:16:58.125
Oh, no, the poison is starting
to work its way through.

00:16:58.125 --> 00:17:02.042
Well, I'd be more worried
about the lower half of you.

00:17:02.042 --> 00:17:04.250
Well, we'll ignore that for now.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:06.625
I'm a goner!

00:17:06.625 --> 00:17:08.583
You idiot, what are you...

00:17:08.583 --> 00:17:11.250
It's okay. Just leave me here.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.750
I could never do that.

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:16.333
Nabeshin, my mask...

00:17:25.583 --> 00:17:27.792
Well? Have I aged?

00:17:27.792 --> 00:17:31.292
Not at all. You're just like
you were in the old days, Tetsuko.

00:17:31.292 --> 00:17:35.292
Nabeshin, one more time?
Like we always used to?

00:17:44.542 --> 00:17:47.500
That's as far as
the love scene goes.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.917
So it was you after all, Nabeshin.

00:17:49.917 --> 00:17:51.875
Haven't seen you
since the war in Bokoda.

00:17:51.875 --> 00:17:53.542
You bastard!

00:17:54.833 --> 00:17:56.333
Fire!

00:18:04.333 --> 00:18:06.167
Tetsuko!

00:18:08.667 --> 00:18:10.500
Nabeshin...

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.167
Tetsuko...

00:18:18.042 --> 00:18:22.708
T-Tetsukooooo!

00:18:29.208 --> 00:18:32.958
We can't allow anyone
to escape from here, you see.

00:18:37.792 --> 00:18:39.583
You bastards!

00:18:54.708 --> 00:18:59.292
<i>I'm lost and I'm hungry...</i>

00:18:59.292 --> 00:19:00.792
Menchi!

00:19:04.542 --> 00:19:05.750
Don't move!

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:07.250
Oh, my!

00:19:14.792 --> 00:19:16.500
Splendid, Nabeshin!

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:19.292
Truly a Ninja Commando from Hell!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:25.000
Run! Run! Run!

00:19:29.125 --> 00:19:30.792
This is it!

00:19:36.417 --> 00:19:38.083
I have won!

00:19:40.458 --> 00:19:42.958
How dare you!

00:19:54.792 --> 00:19:56.792
M-Micky...

00:20:00.792 --> 00:20:04.292
Menchi, it's okay, I'm not mad.

00:20:04.292 --> 00:20:06.917
You just wanted to
come along too, right?

00:20:10.333 --> 00:20:13.500
Menchi, nothing
good is born of war.

00:20:13.500 --> 00:20:16.083
It is just foolish destruction.

00:20:16.083 --> 00:20:18.583
In the end, a society like this...

00:20:22.792 --> 00:20:25.667
...needs a ruler like Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:20:35.875 --> 00:20:37.875
Sandora!

00:20:37.875 --> 00:20:39.542
Welcome home!

00:20:39.542 --> 00:20:40.917
--I'm home...

00:20:40.917 --> 00:20:43.125
--Oh, you.
--I'm home...

00:20:43.125 --> 00:20:44.750
Dear!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:46.417
W-Why?!

00:20:46.417 --> 00:20:50.333
Papa's home,
so let's have dinner.

00:20:50.333 --> 00:20:51.333
Yeah!

00:20:51.333 --> 00:20:52.667
Papa?

00:20:53.667 --> 00:20:58.208
Oh, Dear, he's become so
completely attached to you.

00:20:58.208 --> 00:21:00.667
Well, he's not the only one, right?

00:21:00.667 --> 00:21:02.333
Oh, Dear!

00:21:05.417 --> 00:21:07.375
"Gomez"

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:15.125
They have me... But my son
and my sexy wife are with Gomez...

00:21:15.125 --> 00:21:18.125
No!

00:21:21.583 --> 00:21:23.833
Well, now that I have had
some sleep and come back to life,

00:21:23.833 --> 00:21:26.375
I suppose I shall return to my duties.

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:37.500
Oh, peace is so wonderful!

00:21:39.917 --> 00:21:43.875
But with only one photograph,
I have no place to start searching.

00:21:43.875 --> 00:21:45.958
Later, I'll apologize to Lord Ilpalazzo

00:21:45.958 --> 00:21:47.958
about my unexcused absence.

00:21:47.958 --> 00:21:50.083
Oh, but I guess
dinner comes before that.

00:21:50.083 --> 00:21:52.917
If only I had a few more clues.

00:21:52.917 --> 00:21:54.833
♪ Dinner, dinner. ♪

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:58.583
Oh, my.

00:22:03.667 --> 00:22:05.292
What's this?! What's this?!

00:22:05.292 --> 00:22:08.542
We just met and she's dead already!

00:22:13.792 --> 00:22:18.625
"Episode 3: The Sacrificial Lamb of
the Venomous Great Escape of Hell"

